  "goodToKnow": "Didaktisch means relating to teaching: didaktisch wertvoll, ein didaktisches Konzept. Unlike English didactic, which often sounds preachy, it's mostly neutral or positive. Die Didaktik is the study of teaching methods, a core subject in German teacher training, often paired with Methodik. From Greek didaskein (to teach). Synonyms: pädagogisch, lehrreich."
